

**10.2.15**: \[\sqrt{3}\frac{\pi}{2}K_{n+1}(z) = \frac{1}{2}\pi ie^{(n+1)\frac{1}{2}t/2}h_{n}^{(1)}(ze^{1\pi i})\] \[(-\pi < \arg\,z\leq \frac{1}{2}\pi)\] \[= - \frac{1}{2}\pi ie^{-(n+1)\frac{1}{2}t/2}h_{n}^{(2)}(ze^{-1\pi i}t)\] \[(\frac{1}{2}\pi < \arg\,z\leq\pi)\] \[= (\frac{1}{2}\pi/2)e^{-z}\sum\limits_{0}^{\rm a}\,(n+\frac{1}{2},\, k)(2z)^{-k}\]
**10.2.16**: \[K_{s+4}(z) = K_{-s-1}(z)\qquad(n = 0,\,1,\,2,\,\ldots)\] \[\mbox{The Functions}\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}K_{s+4}(z),n = 0,\,1,\,2\]
**10.2.17**: \[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}K_{1/2}(z) = (\frac{1}{2}\pi/2)e^{-z}\] \[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}K_{1/2}(z) = (\frac{1}{2}\pi/2)e^{-z}(1+z^{-1})\] \[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}K_{1/2}(z) = (\frac{1}{2}\pi/2)e^{-z}(1+3z^{-1}+3z^{-2})\] **Elementary Properties Recurrence Relations**: \[f_{*}(z) : \sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{n+1}(z),\,(-1)^{s+1}\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/ z}K_{n+1}(z)\] ( \[n = 0,\,\pm 1,\,\pm 2,\,\ldots)\]
**10.2.18**: \[f_{n-1}(z) - f_{s+1}(z) = (2n+1)2^{-1}f_{s}(z)\]
**10.2.19**: \[nf_{s-1}(z) + (n+1)f_{s+1}(z) = (2n+1)\frac{d}{dz}\,f_{s}(z)\]
**10.2.20**: \[\frac{n+1}{z}\,f_{s}(z) + \frac{d}{dz}f_{s}(z) = f_{n-1}(z)\] (See 10.2.22.)
**10.2.21**: \[- \frac{n}{z}f_{s}(z) + \frac{d}{dz}f_{s}(z) = \overline{f_{s+1}(z)}\] (See 10.2.23.)
**Differentiation Formulas**: \[f_{*}(z) : \sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{s+1}(z),\,(-1)^{s+1}\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}K_{s+1}(z)\] ( \[n = 0,\,\pm 1,\,\pm 2,\,\ldots)\]
**10.2.22**: \[\left(\frac{1}{z}\,\frac{d}{dz}\right)^{n}[z^{s+1}!f_{n}(z)] = z^{n-m+1}!f_{s-n}(z)\]
**10.2.23**: \[\left(\frac{1}{z}\,\frac{d}{dz}\right)^{n}[z^{-}!f_{n}(z)] = z^{-n-m}\overline{f_{s+n}(z)}\] ( \[m = 1,\,2,\,3,\,\ldots)\]